#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:9 be8d5bf3369d4b7daab3dd04a1f7a4f5
msgid ""
"Rover-4.2.0 (and higher) supports controlling a single `Torqeedo Travel "
"<https://www.torqeedo.com/en/products/outboards/travel>`__, `Ultralight "
"<https://www.torqeedo.com/en/products/outboards/ultralight>`__ or `Cruise "
"<https://www.torqeedo.com/en/products/outboards/cruise>`__ motor using its "
"custom RS485 protocol."
msgstr ""
"Rover-4.2.0（及更高版本）支持通过自定义 RS485 协议控制单台 `Torqeedo Travel "
"<https://www.torqeedo.com/en/products/outboards/travel>`__、`Ultralight "
"<https://www.torqeedo.com/en/products/outboards/ultralight>`__ 或 `Cruise "
"<https://www.torqeedo.com/en/products/outboards/cruise>`__ 电动推进器。"

