#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:27 40169fe68f154ad3bd8926e906f4fe69
msgid "AutoPilot connection"
msgstr "自动驾驶仪连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:29 850130e06b22490ab69a2679ca99d151
msgid ""
"The autopilot can be connected to either the battery's tiller connector or "
"to the motor connector.  If the torqeedo's built-in battery will be used "
"then the autopilot should be connected to the tiller connector.  If instead "
"a separate battery will be used then the autopilot should be connected to "
"the motor connector (and the built-in battery can be removed)"
msgstr ""
"自动驾驶仪可以连接到电池的舵柄连接器或电机连接器。如果使用 Torqeedo "
"内置电池，则自动驾驶仪应连接到舵柄连接器。如果使用独立电池，则应连接到电机连接器（内置电池可以拆除）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:35 efb3c41f35a44744bb58a280c9ea1b1e
msgid ""
"An interface board should be assembled using the parts mentioned above and "
"connected as shown below.  The image on the left shows the wiring if the "
"tiller connector is used, the image on the right is for use of the motor "
"connector"
msgstr "应使用上述零件组装一块接口板，并按如下图示连接。左图显示使用舵柄连接器时的接线，右图显示使用电机连接器时的接线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:43 561ee55a8acb4fddbda853b058f8262d
msgid ""
"If the motor connector method is used with non-torqeedo batteries, be sure "
"to use batteries with built-in short circuit protection.  During early "
"development and testing of this interface, after applying large and rapid "
"changes to the throttle and managed to cause a short circuit within the "
"motor.  A short circuit, especially with large batteries, could lead to a "
"fire and serious injury."
msgstr ""
"如果使用电机连接器方法并搭配非 Torqeedo "
"电池，请务必使用具有内置短路保护的电池。在该接口的早期开发和测试过程中，对油门进行大幅度快速调整后曾导致电机内部短路。短路，尤其是大容量电池的短路，可能导致火灾和严重伤害。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:45 04119886df0f4e1db038fa59ef514bfc
msgid ""
"Below are pictures of the modified throttle extension cable and `Japan "
"Drones RS485-to-Serial converter board "
"<http://japandrones.com/shopdetail/000000000176/ct21/page1/order/>`__"
msgstr ""
"以下是改装后的油门延长线和 `Japan Drones RS485 转串口转换板 "
"<http://japandrones.com/shopdetail/000000000176/ct21/page1/order/>`__ 的图片"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:55 e4c7eb0bbc7c441e8db3dfa9e9cfe583
msgid ""
"Below are pictures of the modified motor extension cable and `Japan Drones "
"RS485-to-Serial converter board "
"<http://japandrones.com/shopdetail/000000000176/ct21/page1/order/>`__"
msgstr ""
"以下是改装后的电机延长线和 `Japan Drones RS485 转串口转换板 "
"<http://japandrones.com/shopdetail/000000000176/ct21/page1/order/>`__ 的图片"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:66 adaf663c4c1e4269ba347c219b5a3f78
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:68 a00e37bf8fc6445f987b2fa78d589867
msgid "Please set the following parameters"
msgstr "请设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:70 eeb3b6b268ed4f3e9b9865a38b4c6f08
msgid ""
"``TRQD_TYPE`` = 1 (Tiller) if the autopilot will be connected to the tiller "
"connector or 2 (Motor) if connected to the motor connector"
msgstr "``TRQD_TYPE`` = 1（舵柄）若自动驾驶仪连接舵柄连接器，或 = 2（电机）若连接电机连接器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:71 f770f27e6a2e48ec8b326f1079c5cd2d
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 39 (Torqeedo) if the Torqeedo "
"is connected to serial port 1.  If another serial port is used please set "
"the appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 39（Torqeedo）若 Torqeedo 连接到串口 "
"1。如使用其他串口，请设置相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:72 ddb27a5a59d9473497e81891357f31ba
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 19 (19200 bps) if using serial port 1."
"  If another serial port is used please set the appropriate SERIALx_BAUD "
"parameter instead"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 19（19200 bps）若使用串口 1。如使用其他串口，请设置相应的 "
"SERIALx_BAUD 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:74 23358706de064022b3ce3b3c66a7f49a
msgid ""
"If a serial port with flow control pins (clear-to-send and ready-to-send) is"
" used no further parameter settings are required.  If serial port without "
"flow-control is used then please set"
msgstr "如果使用具有流控制引脚（清除发送和准备发送）的串口，则无需进一步的参数设置。如果使用不带流控制的串口，请设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:76 99cfeb4d5b134567858cae3849aa723c
msgid ""
"``TRQD_ONOFF_PIN`` = 54 (AUX5) and connect the autopilot's AUX5 pin to the "
"interface's board's MOSFET"
msgstr "``TRQD_ONOFF_PIN`` = 54（AUX5），并将自动驾驶仪的 AUX5 引脚连接到接口板的 MOSFET"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:77 2e331d531c6e4a6b930fdb1549d9f720
msgid ""
"``TRQD_DE_PIN`` = 55 (AUX6) and connect the autopilot's AUX6 pin to the "
"RS485<->TTL converter's DE and RE pins"
msgstr ""
"``TRQD_DE_PIN`` = 55（AUX6），并将自动驾驶仪的 AUX6 引脚连接到 RS485<->TTL 转换器的 DE 和 RE 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:79 f42f1131adfd48b0971a8ebda72336af
msgid ""
"Battery voltage and current information are taken from the Torqeedo battery "
"or motor by setting this parameter"
msgstr "通过设置此参数从 Torqeedo 电池或电机获取电池电压和电流信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:81 f24654f8d88648899e118e6058e85692
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = 23 (Torqeedo)"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = 23（Torqeedo）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:84 2f3e26e08d634fcca4c630c485669a50
msgid "Logging and Reporting"
msgstr "日志记录与报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:86 253038bcfa6a4375874b837c1faa8549
msgid ""
"Motor RPM and temperature along with battery voltage and current are "
"reported to the ground station in real-time using the ESC_TELEMETRY_1_TO_4 "
"mavlink message.  If using Mission Planner (and perhaps other ground "
"stations) these values can be seen on the \"Data\" screen's \"Status\" tab "
"in the \"esc3_curr\", \"esc3_rpm\", etc fields."
msgstr ""
"电机转速、温度以及电池电压和电流通过 ESC_TELEMETRY_1_TO_4 MAVLink 消息实时报告给地面站。如果使用 Mission "
"Planner（以及其他地面站），这些值可在「数据」界面的「状态」选项卡中的「esc3_curr」、「esc3_rpm」等字段中查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:88 96bf48c343374f908483add87dcbb812
msgid ""
"By default \"TRQD\" messages are written to the onboard log at 10hz seconds "
"and include:"
msgstr "默认情况下，「TRQD」消息以 10Hz 的频率写入机载日志，包含以下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:90 3b352f1fc1524ef58c7f79e651c0c399
msgid "Health : whether the autopilot is successfully controlling the motor"
msgstr "Health：自动驾驶仪是否成功控制电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:91 684b38cedc474d8fb0108a28ef832231
msgid ""
"DesMotSpeed : the latest desired motor from the pilot or autopilot expressed"
" as a number from -1000 to +1000"
msgstr "DesMotSpeed：飞手或自动驾驶仪最新的期望电机速度，以 -1000 到 +1000 之间的数字表示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:92 84bbb00110a04e16b0b90f9deb1fac78
msgid ""
"MotSpeed : the latest requested speed sent to the motor as a number from "
"-1000 to +1000"
msgstr "MotSpeed：发送给电机的最新请求速度，以 -1000 到 +1000 之间的数字表示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:93 29774d001ce146bbaff14bba9dd46c7e
msgid ""
"SuccCnt : the number of messages successfully consumed from the motor (this "
"should rise steadily)"
msgstr "SuccCnt：从电机成功接收的消息数量（应稳定上升）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:94 04d5ec06555742598db79a607f8af510
msgid ""
"ErrCnt : the number of bytes or messages that were corrupted or could not be"
" processed (this should be a relatively low number)"
msgstr "ErrCnt：损坏或无法处理的字节或消息数量（应为相对较低的数值）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:96 07ead76e04de4b4294e806e8a04d9490
msgid ""
"The \"TRST\" log message (only available when using the \"Tiller\" "
"connection) includes the Master error code, motor temperature, voltage, "
"current, power (in Watts) and RPM along with the battery percentage state of"
" charge, voltage and current."
msgstr ""
"「TRST」日志消息（仅在使用「舵柄」连接时可用）包含主控错误代码、电机温度、电压、电流、功率（瓦特）和转速，以及电池电量百分比、电压和电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:98 cff116b26d024c9393c6a4253c39743f
msgid ""
"The \"TRSE\" log message (only available when using the \"Tiller\" "
"connection) includes the motor type, battery capacity and software versions."
msgstr "「TRSE」日志消息（仅在使用「舵柄」连接时可用）包含电机类型、电池容量和软件版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:100 02aa5cd3447146109f2813fb33b1ea5d
msgid ""
"The \"TRMP\" log message (only available when using the \"Motor\" "
"connection) includes the motor RPM, power (in Watts), voltage, current and "
"temperature."
msgstr "「TRMP」日志消息（仅在使用「电机」连接时可用）包含电机转速、功率（瓦特）、电压、电流和温度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:102 7a8f836e3f49496ab203902a68bc8099
msgid ""
"This above log information can also be sent as text to the ground station by"
" setting ``TRQD_OPTIONS`` = 3"
msgstr "通过设置 ``TRQD_OPTIONS`` = 3，以上日志信息也可以文本形式发送到地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:105 3acc35f17ecb4f97b1b54d7506d4bd4e
msgid "Introduction Videos"
msgstr "介绍视频"
